# Agent / AI tooling setup.
#
# `.github/`, AGENTS.md and CLAUDE.md were ignored from 2026-09-17 to 2026-09-22
# as "local only, not part of the product". They are now TRACKED, because they are
# hand-authored source with no other copy: on 2026-09-22 `.github/hooks/permissions.json`
# was deleted and git could not restore it — the directory had never been committed —
# so 300 permission rules had to be reconstructed from a stale generated artifact.
# `.github/CONTROL-PLANE-NOTES.md` alone is weeks of forensics that cannot be re-derived.
# There are no workflows here and no credentials; RESEND_API_KEY is pinned to a sentinel.
#
# Generated from .github/ by `pnpm agents:sync` — never committed, never edited by hand
.claude/
.mcp.json

# Scratch output from terminal commands
.tmp-*

# mise writes these into the CWD when it cannot resolve its data dir (its Windows
# shims are currently broken — see AGENTS.md). Harmless but noisy, and `installs/`
# can reach gigabytes, so keep them out of the index.
/downloads/
/installs/
/migrations/

